    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d194-f1" n="84" xml:id="d194-f1-content">
                <p>In the Draft Peace Treaty with Italy under consideration at this time by the
                    Deputies, the list of naval units to be retained by Italy was to appear as Annex
                    5.</p>
